<p>By insisting on a binding contract that details these inclusions, you eliminate the room for negotiation on moving day. This transparency ensures that the price quoted in Karnal is the price paid in Gurgaon. It shifts the burden of proof to the transporter, who must adhere to the agreed terms.</p>
<p>Ultimately, a written quote serves as your legal and practical shield against predatory pricing, allowing you to focus on settling into your new home rather than disputing invoices. Always verify that the company provides this documentation in writing, via email or signed PDF, before handing over your vehicle.</p></div>
