      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Declared-Value Transit Marine Insurance Tariffs &amp; GST Compliance for Bike Transport From Karnal To Gurgaon</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When you hire a professional bike transport service to move your motorcycle from Karnal to Gurgaon, two key cost components—tax and insurance—must be considered. The first is the Goods and Services Tax (GST), the second is the transit marine insurance that protects the bike against loss or damage during the journey.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The transport service provider is a registered taxable entity and must charge GST on the freight value of the bike. Depending on the service package, the applicable rate is either the standard 18% or the reduced 5% rate for “transport of goods” under the Integrated Goods and Services Tax (IGST) regime.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>The 5% rate applies when the service provider is a registered transporter and the freight value is below a certain threshold; otherwise the 18% rate applies</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Transit Marine Insurance:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The insurer calculates the premium as a percentage of the declared value of the bike. Typical rates for motorcycle transport range from 1.5% to 3% of the declared value. For example, a 15,000 INR bike would cost between 225 INR (1.5%) and 450 INR (3%) in insurance premium.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>The policy covers theft, accidental damage, and loss of the bike while it is in transit</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>

<p>In addition to the premium, the insurance policy includes a set of claim protections:</p>

<ul>
<li><strong>Coverage Period:</strong> From the moment the bike is handed over to the transporter until it is delivered to the destination in Gurgaon.</li>
<li><strong>Valuation Method:</strong> The insurer pays the declared value or the market value, whichever is higher, subject to the policy limits.</li>
<li><strong>Exclusions:</strong> Damage caused by improper loading, tampering, or non‑compliance with the transporter’s loading instructions is typically excluded.</li>
<li><strong>Claim Filing:</strong> A claim must be filed within 30 days of delivery, accompanied by the original bill of lading, a police report (if theft is involved), and photographs of the damage.</li>
<li><strong>Reimbursement:</strong> Upon approval, the insurer settles the claim by direct transfer to the bike owner or the transporter, depending on the policy terms.</li>
</ul>

<p>By understanding these statutory tax structures and insurance premiums, you can budget accurately for the journey from Karnal to Gurgaon and ensure your motorcycle is protected against unforeseen events.</p></div>
